      "content": "The extension shouldn't be a problem if it's just minor tweaks. But just so I'm clear on the technical side, will the new constraints on speculativeness affect how you're handling the high-complexity pathways? The devs think the current way you reason can be a bit too 'out there' and want to rein that in.",
